        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Iluminatus</strong> reach the top of each level and escape this strange world! Face off against mutant viruses, creepy llamas, unsettling aliens, and mighty bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a bizarre adventure where you don’t control the character directly—your only action is to <strong>jump to survive</strong>. Beat different levels, unlock the abilities you need, and advance further into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This platformer features two distinct game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Climb massive pyramids, hopping from platform to platform to reach the summit. Every level is a new puzzle that will challenge your wits and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can you make it? Run nonstop through a path packed with enemies and obstacles. Time your jumps, avoid falling, and crush your high score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to escape and uncover the mysteries of this bizarre world?</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help <strong>Iluminatus</strong> reach the top of each level and escape this strange world! Face off against mutant viruses, creepy llamas, unsettling aliens, and mighty bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a bizarre adventure where you don’t control the character directly—your only action is to <strong>jump to survive</strong>. Beat different levels, unlock the abilities you need, and advance further into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This platformer features two distinct game modes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Mode</strong>: Climb massive pyramids, hopping from platform to platform to reach the summit. Every level is a new puzzle that will challenge your wits and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong>: How far can you make it? Run nonstop through a path packed with enemies and obstacles. Time your jumps, avoid falling, and crush your high score.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to escape and uncover the mysteries of this bizarre world?</p>",
        "short_description": "Jump and survive! Help Iluminatus escape a bizarre world full of mutant viruses, creepy llamas, aliens, and powerful bosses! Unlock abilities, climb puzzling levels, or test your skills in endless mode.",
